{
  "name": "@lolly-tools/node-shell",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Shared plumbing for the Lolly CLI, TUI, MCP server AND web shell: repo-root resolution, the scoped headless-Chromium launcher, the web-shell render tier, the resvg raster fast path, the export Content-Credentials payload builder, and the DOM-free halves of PDF/PPTX/text/SVG/ML that the browser shares with the terminal. One implementation so no shell can drift. Every consumer imports through the `exports` map, never by relative path.",
